    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">al-lēvo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adl-</span></b> ), less correctly <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">al-laevo</span></b> , āre, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make
			smooth</i>, <i>to smooth off</i> or <i>over</i> (only in Col.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nodos et cicatrices adlevare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 15, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitem ferro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 24, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ea plaga uno vestigio adlevatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 24, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
